<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African May gold output rises to 39.68 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African May gold output rises to 39.68 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output rose in May to 39,681.1 kg from April's 39,143.7, Chamber of Mines figures show.  </p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p>May 1997     Apr 1997     May 1996    Jan-May 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>39,681.1     39,143.7     40,649.5    199,906.9    205,296.4</p>
<p>(1.28 mln)   (1.26 mln)   (1.31 mln) (6.43 mln)   (6.60 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
